WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.291
Delete permanently removes an enquiry and its notes.

00:00:04.341 --> 00:00:09.536
The confirmation explains what will be lost before anything is removed.

00:00:09.586 --> 00:00:13.600
Choose Cancel if you only wanted to inspect the action.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:18.180
For ordinary follow-up, changing the status is usually enough.
